  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRelatedPartiesConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;【関連当事者情報】&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRelatedPartiesConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
